      "SvgGraphics#text performs the final backend-wide serialization step: it canonicalizes fontFamily equal to Monospaced (case-insensitive) to monospace immediately before writing the attribute, then replaces ASCII spaces with U+00A0 only when the emitted family is monospace or Courier.",
      "Quoted families therefore remain quoted in Java SVG and do not receive NBSP conversion merely because their unquoted payload spells Monospaced."
    ],
